        example: "An $80M corporate sale vote achieves 72% approval, triggering a protective provision veto, while a Series C senior stock authorization achieves 84% approval, satisfying the 75% supermajority requirement.",
        code: "def evaluate_protective_provisions(vote_subject, votes_for, total_eligible_votes, requires_supermajority=True, threshold_pct=75.0):\n    # Protective Provisions (Veto Rights) universally require a 75% Supermajority of Preferred Stock\n    # Examples: Liquidation/Sale of Company, Changing Certificate of Incorporation,\n    # Authorizing Senior Equity Classes, Incurring Debt > $500k, Changing Board Size\n    \n    pct_approved = (votes_for / total_eligible_votes) * 100.0\n    required_pct = threshold_pct if requires_supermajority else 50.0\n    is_approved = pct_approved >= required_pct\n    \n    return {\n        'action_subject': vote_subject,\n        'votes_for': votes_for,\n        'total_votes': total_eligible_votes,\n        'approved_percentage': round(pct_approved, 2),\n        'required_threshold_pct': required_pct,\n        'is_legally_ratified': is_approved,\n        'governance_verdict': 'RATIFIED_BY_SUPERMAJORITY' if is_approved else 'VETOED_PROTECTIVE_PROVISION'\n    }\n\n# Case 1: Proposed M&A Acquisition of Company for $80M (Requires 75% Preferred Supermajority)\n# Preferred Investors: 1,800,000 shares for, 700,000 against -> 72.0%\nma_vote = evaluate_protective_provisions(\n    vote_subject=\"Acquisition / Sale of Company ($80M All-Cash)\",\n    votes_for=1800000,\n    total_eligible_votes=2500000,\n    requires_supermajority=True,\n    threshold_pct=75.0\n)\n\n# Case 2: Authorizing Series C Senior Preferred Stock (Requires 75% Preferred Supermajority)\n# Preferred Investors: 2,100,000 shares for, 400,000 against -> 84.0%\nequity_vote = evaluate_protective_provisions(\n    vote_subject=\"Authorize 2,000,000 Series C Senior Preferred Shares\",\n    votes_for=2100000,\n    total_eligible_votes=2500000,\n    requires_supermajority=True,\n    threshold_pct=75.0\n)\n\nprint(f\"Vote 1 [{ma_vote['action_subject'][:35]}...]: {ma_vote['approved_percentage']}% vs {ma_vote['required_threshold_pct']}% -> {ma_vote['governance_verdict']}\")\nprint(f\"Vote 2 [{equity_vote['action_subject'][:35]}...]: {equity_vote['approved_percentage']}% vs {equity_vote['required_threshold_pct']}% -> {equity_vote['governance_verdict']}\")\n",
