            "example": "Consider a maritime salvage operation. Salvage ships holding first-lien recovery bonds receive their exact salvage costs reimbursed before the vessel's original cargo owners receive any recovered merchandise. If the recovered gold is massive, the salvagers abandon their bond to take twenty-five percent of the total treasure hoard.",
            "code": "def simulate_1x_non_participating_waterfall(investment: float, ownership_pct: float, exit_valuation: float):\n    preference = investment\n    pro_rata_value = exit_valuation * (ownership_pct / 100.0)\n    \n    # Investor elects the higher of 1x preference or pro-rata conversion\n    if pro_rata_value > preference:\n        investor_payout = pro_rata_value\n        decision = \"CONVERT_TO_COMMON\"\n    else:\n        investor_payout = min(preference, exit_valuation)\n        decision = \"TAKE_1X_PREFERENCE\"\n        \n    common_payout = max(0.0, exit_valuation - investor_payout)\n    break_even_exit = preference / (ownership_pct / 100.0)\n    \n    return {\n        \"exit_val\": exit_valuation,\n        \"investor_payout\": investor_payout,\n        \"common_payout\": common_payout,\n        \"decision\": decision,\n        \"break_even\": break_even_exit\n    }\n\ninv = 5000000.0\npct = 25.0\nexits = [4000000.0, 8000000.0, 20000000.0, 40000000.0]\n\nprint(f\"1x Non-Participating Preferred ($5M Investment for 25% Ownership):\")\nprint(f\"Mathematical Break-Even Conversion Valuation: ${inv/(pct/100.0):,.2f}\")\nprint(\"-\" * 75)\nprint(\"Exit Valuation | Investor Payout | Common Payout  | Investor Decision\")\nprint(\"-\" * 75)\nfor ex in exits:\n    res = simulate_1x_non_participating_waterfall(inv, pct, ex)\n    print(f\"${res['exit_val']/1e6:5.1f}M         | ${res['investor_payout']/1e6:6.2f}M        | ${res['common_payout']/1e6:6.2f}M        | {res['decision']}\")",
            "output": "1x Non-Participating Preferred ($5M Investment for 25% Ownership):\nMathematical Break-Even Conversion Valuation: $20,000,000.00\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nExit Valuation | Investor Payout | Common Payout  | Investor Decision\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n$  4.0M         | $  4.00M        | $  0.00M        | TAKE_1X_PREFERENCE\n$  8.0M         | $  5.00M        | $  3.00M        | TAKE_1X_PREFERENCE\n$ 20.0M         | $  5.00M        | $ 15.00M        | TAKE_1X_PREFERENCE\n$ 40.0M         | $ 10.00M        | $ 30.00M        | CONVERT_TO_COMMON\n",
