            "example": "A municipal transit authority models passenger evacuation across five flood scenarios: minor localized leakage, moderate river cresting, severe levee failure, generational storm surge, and complete dam breach. Each scenario activates distinct floodgates and barrier allocations.",
            "code": "def simulate_exit_waterfall(exit_valuation: float, f_pct: float, seed_pct: float, a_pct: float, b_pct: float, b_pref: float, a_pref: float, seed_pref: float, carveout_pct: float = 0.0):\n    # Carve-out evaluated first\n    carveout = exit_valuation * (carveout_pct / 100.0)\n    net_proceeds = exit_valuation - carveout\n    \n    # Check if preferred investors convert to common\n    b_common_val = net_proceeds * (b_pct / 100.0)\n    a_common_val = net_proceeds * (a_pct / 100.0)\n    seed_common_val = net_proceeds * (seed_pct / 100.0)\n    \n    b_converts = b_common_val > b_pref\n    a_converts = a_common_val > a_pref\n    seed_converts = seed_common_val > seed_pref\n    \n    if b_converts and a_converts and seed_converts:\n        # Full conversion scenario (High exit / IPO)\n        b_payout = net_proceeds * (b_pct / 100.0)\n        a_payout = net_proceeds * (a_pct / 100.0)\n        seed_payout = net_proceeds * (seed_pct / 100.0)\n        founder_payout = net_proceeds * (f_pct / 100.0)\n    else:\n        # Tiered seniority: B senior to A senior to Seed\n        rem = net_proceeds\n        b_payout = b_common_val if b_converts else min(rem, b_pref)\n        rem = max(0.0, rem - b_payout)\n        \n        a_payout = a_common_val if a_converts else min(rem, a_pref)\n        rem = max(0.0, rem - a_payout)\n        \n        seed_payout = seed_common_val if seed_converts else min(rem, seed_pref)\n        rem = max(0.0, rem - seed_payout)\n        \n        founder_payout = rem * (f_pct / (f_pct + (0.0 if not a_converts else a_pct)))\n        \n    return {\n        \"exit\": exit_valuation,\n        \"carveout\": carveout,\n        \"b_payout\": b_payout,\n        \"a_payout\": a_payout,\n        \"seed_payout\": seed_payout,\n        \"founder_payout\": founder_payout\n    }\n\nscenarios = [\n    (\"Distressed M&A\", 20000000.0, 15.0),\n    (\"Downside Recap\", 50000000.0, 0.0),\n    (\"Strategic Sale\", 100000000.0, 0.0),\n    (\"Upside PE Buyout\", 250000000.0, 0.0),\n    (\"Hyper-Growth IPO\", 600000000.0, 0.0)\n]\n\nprint(\"Milestone 7 5-Scenario Comprehensive Liquidation Waterfall:\")\nprint(\"-\" * 80)\nprint(\"Scenario          | Exit Val | Carveout | Series B    | Series A    | Founder Payout\")\nprint(\"-\" * 80)\nfor name, ex, carve in scenarios:\n    res = simulate_exit_waterfall(ex, 40.63, 8.58, 21.21, 20.31, 30000000.0, 10000000.0, 1545000.0, carve)\n    print(f\"{name:17s} | ${res['exit']/1e6:5.1f}M  | ${res['carveout']/1e6:4.1f}M    | ${res['b_payout']/1e6:6.2f}M   | ${res['a_payout']/1e6:6.2f}M   | ${res['founder_payout']/1e6:6.2f}M\")",
            "output": "Milestone 7 5-Scenario Comprehensive Liquidation Waterfall:\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nScenario          | Exit Val | Carveout | Series B    | Series A    | Founder Payout\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDistressed M&A    | $ 20.0M  | $ 3.0M    | $ 17.00M   | $  0.00M   | $  0.00M\nDownside Recap    | $ 50.0M  | $ 0.0M    | $ 30.00M   | $ 10.61M   | $  3.35M\nStrategic Sale    | $100.0M  | $ 0.0M    | $ 30.00M   | $ 21.21M   | $ 26.42M\nUpside PE Buyout  | $250.0M  | $ 0.0M    | $ 50.77M   | $ 53.02M   | $101.58M\nHyper-Growth IPO  | $600.0M  | $ 0.0M    | $121.86M   | $127.26M   | $243.78M\n",
