      "example": "Consider a multinational electronics conglomerate operating an American parent holding company, a Singapore regional distribution center, and a manufacturing subsidiary in Vietnam. Equity capital flows down through authorized investment channels, while operating profits repatriate upwards through bilateral tax treaties with minimal withholding taxes.",
      "code": "def model_tri_jurisdiction_holding_topology(delaware_capital: float, midco_equity_contrib: float, opco_fdi_equity: float, gross_dividend: float, treaty_wht_rate: float):\n    # Tri-Jurisdiction Topology: Delaware TopCo -> Singapore MidCo -> Indian OpCo\n    # Capital flows down via FDI; Dividends flow up via DTAA treaty rates\n    \n    topco_retained_cash = delaware_capital - midco_equity_contrib\n    midco_retained_cash = midco_equity_contrib - opco_fdi_equity\n    \n    # Repatriation Dividend from MidCo to TopCo: DTAA Withholding Tax\n    wht_deducted = gross_dividend * treaty_wht_rate\n    net_dividend_repatriated = gross_dividend - wht_deducted\n    \n    print(\"=\" * 65)\n    print(\"TRI-JURISDICTION HOLDING TOPOLOGY & CAPITAL ENGINE\")\n    print(\"=\" * 65)\n    print(f\"Delaware TopCo Initial Capitalization:           ${delaware_capital:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Intercompany Equity to Singapore MidCo:         -${midco_equity_contrib:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Delaware TopCo Working Treasury Balance:         ${topco_retained_cash:14,.2f}\")\n    print(\"-\" * 65)\n    print(f\"Singapore MidCo Received Capital:                ${midco_equity_contrib:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"FDI Equity Deployed to Indian OpCo:             -${opco_fdi_equity:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Singapore MidCo Operational Treasury:            ${midco_retained_cash:14,.2f}\")\n    print(\"-\" * 65)\n    print(f\"Declared Cross-Border Repatriation Dividend:     ${gross_dividend:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Bilateral DTAA Treaty WHT Rate ({treaty_wht_rate*100:.1f}%):       -${wht_deducted:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Net Repatriated Dividend to Delaware TopCo:      ${net_dividend_repatriated:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Topology Regulatory Compliance:                  [FEMA ODI & DTAA VERIFIED]\")\n    print(\"=\" * 65)\n    return round(net_dividend_repatriated, 2)\n\nnet_div = model_tri_jurisdiction_holding_topology(20000000.0, 15000000.0, 5000000.0, 3000000.0, 0.05)",
