        "Phase Four is the Shareholder Lawsuit and Liquidity Winter. Furious preferred venture investors discover unauthorized third-party hedge funds sitting on the cap table, demanding inspection of confidential board minutes. Pre-IPO institutional crossover funds walk away from lead investments, citing toxic cap table contamination. The company enters a multi-year governance winter, spending millions of dollars on forensic audits and legal compounding to clean up its corporate records.",
