      "example": "Consider Deep-Water Geothermal Wellhead Drilling: sinking specialized casing pipes thousands of meters deep into stable volcanic bedrock requires international seismic monitoring treaties and environmental covenants before drilling commences. Similarly, welcoming multi-hundred-million-dollar sovereign wealth funds onto a tech unicorn's capitalization table requires CFIUS critical technology reviews, Indian Press Note 3 FDI clearances, and irrevocable sovereign immunity waivers.",
      "code": "# Day 57 Part 1: Sovereign Wealth Fund Syndication & Geopolitical Risk Engine\ndef evaluate_sovereign_wealth_fund_syndicate(total_round_size_usd, lead_ticket_usd, co_investors):\n    # Foreign Sovereign Investment Screening Invariants:\n    # 1. Critical Tech + Foreign Sovereign = Mandatory CFIUS Review (US)\n    # 2. Bordering Country Beneficial Ownership = Mandatory Press Note 3 Clearance (India)\n    # 3. Sovereign Immunity Waiver required for all state-owned allocators\n    total_co_investor_capital = sum(c[\"ticket_usd\"] for c in co_investors)\n    assert (lead_ticket_usd + total_co_investor_capital) == total_round_size_usd, \"Tickets must equal round size!\"\n    \n    syndicate_dossier = []\n    cfius_mandatory_count = 0\n    press_note_3_count = 0\n    \n    for c in co_investors:\n        name = c[\"name\"]\n        jurisdiction = c[\"jurisdiction\"]\n        is_sovereign = c.get(\"is_state_owned_swf\", False)\n        bordering = c.get(\"shares_land_border_india\", False)\n        critical_tech_access = c.get(\"demands_critical_tech_access\", False)\n        \n        needs_cfius = is_sovereign and critical_tech_access\n        needs_pn3 = bordering\n        \n        if needs_cfius:\n            cfius_mandatory_count += 1\n        if needs_pn3:\n            press_note_3_count += 1\n            \n        waiver_status = \"MANDATORY EXECUTION (SIAC ARBITRATION)\" if is_sovereign else \"NOT APPLICABLE\"\n        \n        syndicate_dossier.append({\n            \"name\": name,\n            \"ticket_usd\": c[\"ticket_usd\"],\n            \"allocation_pct\": (c[\"ticket_usd\"] / total_round_size_usd) * 100.0,\n            \"jurisdiction\": jurisdiction,\n            \"cfius_review\": \"MANDATORY\" if needs_cfius else \"CLEAR (NON-CONTROLLING)\",\n            \"press_note_3\": \"GOVERNMENT APPROVAL REQUIRED\" if needs_pn3 else \"AUTOMATIC ROUTE\",\n            \"sovereign_waiver\": waiver_status\n        })\n        \n    return {\n        \"round_size_usd\": total_round_size_usd,\n        \"lead_ticket_usd\": lead_ticket_usd,\n        \"co_investor_capital_usd\": total_co_investor_capital,\n        \"cfius_mandatory_count\": cfius_mandatory_count,\n        \"press_note_3_count\": press_note_3_count,\n        \"dossier\": syndicate_dossier\n    }\n\nco_investors_list = [\n    {\"name\": \"GIC Singapore Sovereign\", \"ticket_usd\": 100000000.0, \"jurisdiction\": \"Singapore\", \"is_state_owned_swf\": True, \"shares_land_border_india\": False, \"demands_critical_tech_access\": False},\n    {\"name\": \"Mubadala Investment Capital\", \"ticket_usd\": 80000000.0, \"jurisdiction\": \"UAE\", \"is_state_owned_swf\": True, \"shares_land_border_india\": False, \"demands_critical_tech_access\": True},\n    {\"name\": \"Cross-Border Sovereign SPV\", \"ticket_usd\": 20000000.0, \"jurisdiction\": \"Hong Kong / Border Entity\", \"is_state_owned_swf\": True, \"shares_land_border_india\": True, \"demands_critical_tech_access\": False}\n]\n\nres_swf = evaluate_sovereign_wealth_fund_syndicate(\n    total_round_size_usd=300000000.0, # USD 300M Mega-Round\n    lead_ticket_usd=100000000.0,      # USD 100M Private Equity Lead\n    co_investors=co_investors_list\n)\n\nprint(\"[SOVEREIGN WEALTH FUND MEGA-ROUND SYNDICATION & GEOPOLITICAL RISK ENGINE]\")\nprint(\"Total Round Size: USD {:,.2f} | Lead PE Ticket: USD {:,.2f}\".format(\n    res_swf[\"round_size_usd\"], res_swf[\"lead_ticket_usd\"]\n))\nprint(\"Co-Investor Capital: USD {:,.2f} | Mandatory CFIUS Filings: {} | Press Note 3 Clearances: {}\".format(\n    res_swf[\"co_investor_capital_usd\"], res_swf[\"cfius_mandatory_count\"], res_swf[\"press_note_3_count\"]\n))\nprint(\"\\n[SOVEREIGN CO-INVESTOR COMPLIANCE DOSSIER]\")\nfor d in res_swf[\"dossier\"]:\n    print(\"Allocator: {} (USD {:,.2f} | {:.1f}%) | Origin: {}\".format(\n        d[\"name\"], d[\"ticket_usd\"], d[\"allocation_pct\"], d[\"jurisdiction\"]\n    ))\n    print(\"   CFIUS: {} | India FDI: {} | Immunity Waiver: {}\".format(\n        d[\"cfius_review\"], d[\"press_note_3\"], d[\"sovereign_waiver\"]\n    ))\n",
      "output": "[SOVEREIGN WEALTH FUND MEGA-ROUND SYNDICATION & GEOPOLITICAL RISK ENGINE]\nTotal Round Size: USD 300,000,000.00 | Lead PE Ticket: USD 100,000,000.00\nCo-Investor Capital: USD 200,000,000.00 | Mandatory CFIUS Filings: 1 | Press Note 3 Clearances: 1\n\n[SOVEREIGN CO-INVESTOR COMPLIANCE DOSSIER]\nAllocator: GIC Singapore Sovereign (USD 100,000,000.00 | 33.3%) | Origin: Singapore\n   CFIUS: CLEAR (NON-CONTROLLING) | India FDI: AUTOMATIC ROUTE | Immunity Waiver: MANDATORY EXECUTION (SIAC ARBITRATION)\nAllocator: Mubadala Investment Capital (USD 80,000,000.00 | 26.7%) | Origin: UAE\n   CFIUS: MANDATORY | India FDI: AUTOMATIC ROUTE | Immunity Waiver: MANDATORY EXECUTION (SIAC ARBITRATION)\nAllocator: Cross-Border Sovereign SPV (USD 20,000,000.00 | 6.7%) | Origin: Hong Kong / Border Entity\n   CFIUS: CLEAR (NON-CONTROLLING) | India FDI: GOVERNMENT APPROVAL REQUIRED | Immunity Waiver: MANDATORY EXECUTION (SIAC ARBITRATION)\n",
